Hi, all,

I want to test the script of tpm2_policyauthorize, but failed.
All of the steps is referenced the page https://github.com/tpm2-software/tp=
m2-tools/blob/master/man/tpm2_policyauthorize.1.md.
Basically,

  1.  Generate a key pair using openssl
  2.  Use private key to sign the PCR policy.
  3.  Build authorize policy with PCR policy, and public key.
  4.  Create nv index with policy read/write.
  5.  Verify the signature and generate ticket.
  6.  Build authorize policy with public key, PCR policy and ticket.
  7.  Write nv index.

But I don't know why met the error of 0x1C4 on step 6.
The log is as below, anybody can help check? Many thanks.

